# Changelog
All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

## [Released]

## [4.1.0] - 2026-10-30
- Added link to peer-reviewed publication.
- Fixed direct path summed strength being divided by the number of emitters.
- Fixed emitter path length skipping intermediate bounces for the third bounce and later.
- Fixed horizontal slice rays using degrees instead of radians. A single ray no longer gives NaN.
- Fixed summed strength of specular points only keeping the last emitter and receiver pair.
- Fixed diffraction counting emitters that cannot see the surface.
- Fixed specular points skipped by only-last-hits staying in the world frame.
- Fixed data race on the maximum strength of the specular component.
- Fixed EnableDiffractionForDynamicObjects not being used. Skeletal meshes are now skipped for diffraction unless enabled.
- Fixed default object material transition ignoring the settings.
- Fixed specular air absorption using the sensor distance instead of the emitter to receiver path.

## [4.0.1] - 2026-07-17
- Fixes to raytracing pipeline for compatibility with Cosys-AirSim (https://github.com/Cosys-Lab/Cosys-AirSim).

## [4.0.0] - 2026-07-16
- Upgraded to Unreal Engine 5.8 with support for Linux systems through Vulkan. 
- Added Python API Client (https://github.com/Cosys-Lab/sonotraceuepy).

## [3.1.0] - 2026-02-24
- Added links to paper preprint and video. 
- Added maximum threshold to mesh triangle count to prevent long computation times and memory usage for high resolution meshes. 
- Added demonstrator build for the specular raytracing in large scale environment. Available for download on the releases page.

## [3.0.0] - 2026-02-17
- Added parallel processing to diffraction component to speed up computation time.
- Added emitter and receiver simple directivity model support for passive/direct mode. 
- Added visualisation for strength for direct mode next to the LOS visualisation.
- Added several debug functions to help with calculating computation analysis results.

## [2.0.0] - 2026-01-16
- Added SceneCapture to Pawn and retrieved camera capture to place into DataMessage example.
- Added emitter and receiver simple directivity model.
- Fixed for total summed strength for diffraction component points.
- Fixed specular reflection direction being opposite for maximum strength.

## [1.0.0] - 2026-01-09
- First release.
